    "noteZh": "首屏正中是巨大的 HyperUI 字标，下面一句 Free Open Source Tailwind CSS Components，正文写 With a range of components, you can build your next marketing website, admin dashboard, eCommerce store；再往下是 HyperUI Tools 一条横幅（Generate dark mode variants and map typography scales — all in the browser.，右侧 Browse tools 按钮），然后 Application Components 一组的卡片开始铺开——Accordions、Badges、Breadcrumbs 各带 10 components 的数量标注。页脚写着 Built by Mark Mead 与 Released under the MIT License。",
